WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.370
[Engines rev]

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.230
And they're away at Shikisai!

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.280
Eighteen runs in the same Aston Martin Vulcan,

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.020
all leaving the line together.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.160
Captain Compass in amber.
Look for Fish in teal.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.380
Three hundred kilometres an hour!

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.680
Now he's on the brakes for the first sweeper.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.430
Back on the power.
Watch that teal car into turn two.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.490
Fish in fifth on the way in.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:28.670
Fourth!

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.410
Third!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.390
He's alongside!

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.050
Second!

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.300
Fish takes the lead!

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:38.900
[Engines swell and recede as the pack passes]
